      en: ["The gate was constructed in 1361 as part of the city's second defensive perimeter.", "It was named after Saint Francis because it stands adjacent to the Franciscan monastery.", "An ancient stone plaque inside the gate warns that carrying weapons is strictly forbidden.", "The coat of arms displayed on the facade dates back to the mid-15th century.", "Significant structural reinforcements were carried out in 1451 and 1581.", "It served as the primary customs house for the city until the early modern period."],
